  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased agricultural productivity and income for vulnerable households in a sustainably in a sustainable environment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This result will focus on building extensive local agricultural and economic capacities to improve the economic potential of agricultural and pastoral livelihoods at the manteqa level while fostering environmentally, healthy and economically productive land and provide sustainable income generating opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
